   "heading": {
    "en": "Sum is odd, carry is majority"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "For any adder, the sum bit is 1 when an odd number of inputs are 1 (that is XOR), and the carry is 1 when at least two inputs are 1 (a majority vote)."
   },
